        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have exclusively licensed a portfolio of patent families from UCSB that cover compositions and methods related to screening for and identification of masks and protease-cleavable linkers that we have used to design some PROBODY therapeutics and may use to design future PROBODY therapeutics.",
